    <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-334" contextRef="c-04">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;During the June 2025 annual meeting, Clay Bohmbach was elected as a Director replacing Tim Wasem. During the June 2025 reorganization meeting, Travis Thompson replaced Tim Wasem as Secretary/Treasurer and Cameron Wahlstrom replaced Travis Thompson as Director-at-Large.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-335" contextRef="c-04">&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;The Cooperative has filed a lawsuit against its main power supplier and its intermediate power supplier.&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;The Cooperative claims the main power supplier power rates have been increased due to the supplier's unreasonable and imprudent operation of one of its subsidiaries.&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;These increased rates were then passed on to the intermediate power supplier and ultimately to the Cooperative's members.&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
    <ferc:OtherRegulatoryLiabilities id="f-337" contextRef="c-77" unitRef="u-02" decimals="0">1189433</ferc:OtherRegulatoryLiabilities>
